{:edb/db-before-t 1348 :edb/db-after-t 1349 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534661 50 #inst "2026-10-08T03:34:03.522Z" 13194139534661 true] [17592186087412 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting\n\n$$\nx={\\dfrac{\\pi}{24}}\n$$\n\ninto the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos^{2} (\\frac{π}{24}) - \\sin^{2} (\\frac{π}{24}) &= \\cos (2 \\cdot \\frac{π}{24}) \\\\\n&= \\cos (\\frac{π}{12})\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534661 false] [17592186087412 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={\\dfrac{\\pi}{24}}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})-{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534661 true] [17592186087413 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n2 \\cos^2 x - 1 = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting\n\n$$\nx={\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}}\n$$\n\ninto the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2\\cos^{2} (\\frac{π}{3}) - 1 &= \\cos (2 \\cdot \\frac{π}{3}) \\\\\n&= \\cos (\\frac{2π}{3})\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534661 false] [17592186087413 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n2 \\cos^2 x - 1 = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-1 & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534661 true] [17592186087414 1100 "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of $\\cos^2\\left( 22.5^\\circ\\right) - \\sin^2\\left( 22.5^\\circ\\right).$" 13194139534661 true] [17592186087414 1100 "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of $\\cos^2\\left(22.5^\\circ\\right) - \\sin^2\\left(22.5^\\circ\\right)$." 13194139534661 false] [17592186087414 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting\n\n$$\nx={22.5^\\circ}\n$$\n\ninto the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos^{2} (22.5^{∘}) - \\sin^{2} (22.5^{∘}) &= \\cos (2 \\cdot 22.5^{∘}) \\\\\n&= \\cos 45^{∘} \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534661 false] [17592186087414 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={22.5^\\circ}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {22.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534661 true] [17592186087606 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302056 13194139534661 true] [17592186087606 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302088 13194139534661 true] [17592186087607 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302081 13194139534661 true] [17592186087607 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302095 13194139534661 true] [17592186087608 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302063 13194139534661 true] [17592186087608 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302070 13194139534661 true] [17592186087608 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302077 13194139534661 true] [17592186088039 1100 "Express $\\cos^{2} (\\frac{3π}{4}) - \\sin^{2} (\\frac{3π}{4})$ as a single trigonometric ratio." 13194139534661 false] [17592186088039 1100 "Express ${cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})$ as a single trigonometric ratio." 13194139534661 true] [17592186088053 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534661 true] [17592186088053 1100 "Find the exact value of $1 - 2\\sin^{2} (67.5^{∘})$." 13194139534661 false] [17592186088053 1100 "Find the exact value of $1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}).$" 13194139534661 true] [17592186088053 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={67.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-